Third-party data

MSC metadata in js/msc-data.js is aggregated from matrix-spec-proposals:
  https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

PR discussion text in js/msc-comments.js is aggregated from public GitHub
comments on matrix-spec-proposals pull requests. Comment text remains the
property of its respective authors.

Proposal markdown is fetched at runtime from GitHub and is not redistributed
in this repository.
